'' A PROGRAM THAT IMPORTS A MODULE BUILDS IT AND LINKS IT (ADR 0017, P3). The graph is read
'' from main.bas's header; acme.banner is compiled as one unit into an intermediate object;
'' main.bas is compiled with '#import' no longer TKO0992; the two are linked. The module's
'' top-level code runs before the program's. This program names nothing of it --
'' iface-link.test does.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i tests/modules/src/build/libs tests/modules/src/build/app/main.bas -o tests/modules/buildlink.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0992
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/modules/buildlink.exe
'' RUN: tests/modules/buildlink.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: banner init
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: main
